# Agentic state of this project: session memory (.context/) and the plan kanban (plan/).
# It lives OUTSIDE the repository, in ../.context and ../plan, reached through two local
# Windows junctions created by hand (see the workspace README). The kanban columns are not
# versioned; the rule below keeps a stray copy out of git.
# Exception: plan/README.md is tracked by force-add (`git add -f plan/README.md`), not by a
# gitignore negation. CI reads it as the plan-board contract, yet its content stays a
# user-only decision. Force-add is required because this rule deliberately ignores all of
# plan/ — including that single board doc.
.context/
plan/

# Local install output of `./install.sh project` — the opencode2 development tree
# (agent/command/skill copies, context, local model profile, node_modules).
# Regenerated locally; never committed. Holds a local API key in opencode.jsonc.
.opencode/

# Hermes agent local state (plan-mode drafts, scratch notes).
.hermes/
